Pilot and evaluation use
------------------------
Where Apex grants an organisation access to a running instance for pilot
or evaluation purposes, that access is a revocable licence to USE the
service only. It conveys no ownership of, and no licence to, the software
itself.

Customer data
-------------
Data entered by a pilot or customer organisation — its projects, tasks,
hours, photographs and receipts — belongs to that organisation, not to
Apex. Apex owns the software; the customer owns its records. Nothing in
this notice claims otherwise, and the two should be separated in writing
before any customer data is entered.

Third-party components
----------------------
This project depends on third-party open-source software, including
supabase-swift and PostgreSQL, each governed by its own licence. Those
licences are unaffected by this notice and continue to apply to those
components.
